- ChurnAlerts: monthly churn overlay in Priority tab surfaces Diamond/Platinum
  who had deposits in prev complete month but zero in latest month (P0-1/P0-3);
  fix missing forEach closing paren that broke production build
- RetentionWorkspace: add pendingMonth state and '▶ Generate List' button so
  month selector no longer auto-loads on change (P0-2)
- RetentionQueue: Reactivated outcome now upserts to reactivation_logs in
  addition to contact_logs; quick log modal shows recovery deposit + currency
  fields when outcome=Reactivated; validation requires both before saving (P0-6)

