From cfc70b480cf1ef2ca6d7e397a25db1c2801a5dc9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 16:15:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/15] feat: add one-click monthly PPT report generator
 (/monthly-report)

- Add src/lib/pptReportGenerator.js: core 33-slide PPT engine using
  pptxgenjs (browser-compatible). Fetches all data from Supabase in
  parallel (vip_monthly_totals, reactivation_logs, vip_daily_snapshots,
  campaigns, department_expenses). Dark navy theme (0D1B3E). Reuses
  calculateRetentionMetrics() from retentionAnalytics.js.
- Add src/pages/MonthlyReportExport.jsx: UI page with month picker,
  live KPI preview tiles, data source indicators, 33-slide coverage
  map (AUTO/APPROX/PLACEHOLDER), and generate+download button.
- Register /monthly-report route in App.jsx (admin only).
- Add "Monthly PPT" nav item to Intelligence group in Sidebar.jsx.
- Install pptxgenjs npm dependency.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WNVUMRAtYbcfmnHMnYyCvn
